  "id": "filial-responsibility",
  "term": "filial responsibility",
  "definition": "Filial responsibility is the social and cultural expectation that adult children should care for and support their aging parents. It is reflected in their attitudes and actions toward helping and caregiving within the parent-child relationship.",
